## The turbine hall

::bg{location="power-plant" time="night"}
::music{playback="change" mood="tense" volume="down"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The plant has been shut for ten years. Nobody has told the machines. Every turbine is turning, slowly, and every bulb in the hall is lit.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Magnetick drift between the pylons like dust in a sunbeam. The floor tingles through your shoes.
@narrator{code="0030"}: At the far end of the hall, a stair goes up toward the chimney. The air on it smells like a storm.
